                                            <h5 class="pb-0">S Ravikumar</h5>
                                        </div>
                                                                            <div class="c-about-us-profile-card__items__item__content__description">
                                            Mr. Ravikumar joined Bajaj in June 1984 as an Accounts Officer and is now the Chief Business Development Officer. He is an active member of the Institute of Chartered Accountants of India.
                                        </div>
                                    <div class="c-about-us-profile-card__items__item__content__designation">
                                            <p>Chief Business Development Officer</p>
