                                        </div>
                                                                            <div class="c-about-us-profile-card__items__item__content__description">
                                            <p>Mr Sumeet Narang is heading Bajaj Auto’s Central Marketing Unit as President since November 2024. He joined Bajaj Auto Ltd in 2014 as Vice President (Marketing-Motorcycle Business) and later moved to President (Probiking Business) in 2019. </p><br>

<p>He is a 1993 batch MBA from IMT Ghaziabad and 1991 batch commerce graduate from Shri Ram College of Commerce, Delhi. In a career spanning 3 decades, Mr. Narang has worked in leading companies like Gillette, Procter & Gamble, Coca Cola and Samsung.</p>
