                                                                            <div class="c-about-us-profile-card__items__item__content__description">
                                            <span style="background-color: #ffffff; color: #202124;"><p>Rajiv Gandhi joined Bajaj Auto in February 2023. Prior to joining Bajaj Auto, he was the Company Secretary & Compliance Officer of Ambuja Cements Limited for fifteen years, while simultaneously heading the Corporate Secretarial for ACC Limited.</p>
<p>Over a career spanning 3 decades, he has held the role of Company Secretary in organizations like Zenith Birla Ltd and Ford Credit Kotak Mahindra Ltd.</p>
<p>Rajiv is a qualified Company Secretary with a Bachelors’ in Commerce from Mumbai University.</p>
