                                                                            <div class="c-about-us-profile-card__items__item__content__description">
                                            <p>Mr. Sarang Kanade joined Bajaj in February 2019 as President (Motorcycle Business). He is a Mechanical Engineer from SPCE, 1992 and MMS (Marketing) from NMIMS, 1996. He has 23 years of experience in leading businesses across industries. </p>
