                                <div class="c-about-us-profile-card__items__item__content">
                                        <div class="c-about-us-profile-card__items__item__content__title">
                                            <h5 class="pb-0">Manik Nangia</h5>
                                        </div>
                                                                            <div class="c-about-us-profile-card__items__item__content__description">
                                            <p>Manik Nangia joined Bajaj Auto in 2021 as the head of Digital Transformation and Analytics. Over 3 years he has led the crafting of a new sales management system, Digital marketing practice and data & analytics work streams across business units. Starting Nov 24, he leads the Probiking unit. Passionate about performance motorcycling, he is a strong believer in collective power of a driven team.</p>

 

<p>Before joining Bajaj Auto, Manik worked in financial services with the ICICI group, Max Life Insurance and the Bharti group in various roles over 22 years. His experience over the last 15 years includes leadership positions in product management, marketing, digital transformation and operations.</p>

 

<p>Manik is an MBA from IMT Ghaziabad.</p>
                                        </div>
