                                <div class="c-about-us-profile-card__items__item__content">
                                        <div class="c-about-us-profile-card__items__item__content__title">
                                            <h5 class="pb-0">Samardeep Subandh</h5>
                                        </div>
                                                                            <div class="c-about-us-profile-card__items__item__content__description">
                                            <p>Samardeep joined Bajaj Auto in May 2019. He brings with him 20 years of rich experience across Brand Management, Product Development, Sales & Distribution, and Customer Management. He has held leadership positions in Unilever, Marico, Flipkart, and most recently in D-Mart. Samar holds a B.E degree in Mechanical Engineering, and a Post Graduate Diploma in Management from IIM, Calcutta.</p>

                                        </div>
                                    <div class="c-about-us-profile-card__items__item__content__designation">
