                                                    <img src="https://cdn.bajajauto.com/-/media/assets/bajajauto/about-us/bajaj-team/board-of-directors/new/desktop/pradeep-shrivastava.jpg" loading="lazy" alt="" title="" height="100%" width="100%">
                                                </picture>

